  "abstract": "{\"business_domain\":[\"巨量营销-线索、表单与互动\"],\"business_line\":[\"巨量营销\"],\"capability_summary\":\"用户可以通过此接口获取已有智能电话实例列表，可用于建站，列表栏包括智能电话实例ID、实例名称、是否为真实可接通的电话、电话id、电话号码、创建时间等信息。配合接口有获取Access-Token接口和附录-返回码接口。\",\"id\":\"ad.smart_phone.get\",\"interface_path\":\"/open_api/2/tools/clue/smart_phone/get/\",\"method\":\"GET\",\"official_url\":\"https://open.oceanengine.com/skiff/api/doc/client/markdown/get/?language=CHINESE\\u0026doc_id=1696710621120524\",\"related_docs\":[{\"id\":\"get_access_token\",\"path\":\"\",\"reason\":\"请求此接口需要授权access-token，获取方法见该接口文档\",\"relation\":\"前置接口\",\"title\":\"获取Access-Token\"},{\"id\":\"appendix_return_code\",\"path\":\"\",\"reason\":\"此接口应答参数中的返回码和返回信息详见该接口文档\",\"relation\":\"配合接口\",\"title\":\"附录-返回码\"}],\"risk_level\":\"low\",\"schema_url\":\"https://open.oceanengine.com/skiff/api/doc/client/schema/markdown/get/?doc_id=1696710621120524\",\"title\":\"建站工具——查询已有智能电话\"}",
  "content": "<div class=\"qz-editor-view qz-editor-engine am-engine\" data-element=\"root\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-vc7PSPCV\">通过此接口，用户可以获取已有智能电话实例列表，可用于建站。<span style=\"color: #eb1010;\"></span></p><blockquote data-id=\"b603af74-tddUmTUM\" style=\"margin-top: 5px; margin-bottom: 5px; padding-left: 1em; margin-left: 0px; border-left: 3px solid rgb(238, 238, 238); opacity: 0.6;\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-BdfgbZFF\">列表栏包括智能电话实例ID、实例名称、是否为真实可接通的电话、电话id、电话号码、创建时间等信息。</p></blockquote>\n<div class=\"qz-api-metadata\" data-type=\"apimetadata\" data-value=\"data:%7B%22interfaceId%22%3A%201774299425817668%2C%20%22docLibId%22%3A%201743864733602830%7D\">\n \n</div>\n<h3 data-id=\"h6f20189-zusfnizU\" id=\"link-0\">请求地址</h3><p data-id=\"p838747a-uOxk5B2m\"><a href=\"https://ad.oceanengine.com/open_api/2/tools/clue/smart_phone/get/\" style=\"font-size: inherit; padding: 0px 2px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color: #333333;\">https://ad.oceanengine.com/open_api/2/tools/clue/smart_phone/get/</span></a><a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/tools/visual_debug.html?docId=1696710621120524\" style=\"font-size: 12px;color: #fff; display: inline-block; padding: 2px 8px;border-radius: 4px;background: #2a55e5;margin-left: 8px; color: #fff !important;\" target=\"_blank\">可视化调试</a><a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1773083358100557\" style=\"font-size: 12px;color: #fff; display: inline-block; padding: 2px 8px;border-radius: 4px;background: #2a55e5;margin-left: 8px; color: #fff !important;\" target=\"_blank\">SDK下载</a><a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1847394521222599\" style=\"font-size: 12px;color: #fff; display: inline-block; padding: 2px 8px;border-radius: 4px;background: #2a55e5;margin-left: 8px; color: #fff !important;\" target=\"_blank\">MCP调用</a></p><h3 data-id=\"h6f20189-KPQmjtWD\" id=\"link-1\">请求方法</h3><p data-id=\"p838747a-pHvF5Zy1\">GET</p><h3 data-id=\"h6f20189-oPvBA7xy\" id=