auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; margin: 4px 8px; border: 1px solid rgb(217, 217, 217); padding: 4px 8px; cursor: default;\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-13dMK61R\">number</p></td><td class=\"table-last-column table-last-row\" colspan=\"1\" data-id=\"tc5b1a8b-BMc6HDab\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; width: 100%; height: 100%; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; margin: 4px 8px; border: 1px solid rgb(217, 217, 217); padding: 4px 8px; cursor: default;\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-CUngzDuO\">页面大小，默认10条每页，范围：page_size &gt;= 1</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div><h3 data-id=\"h6f20189-LajtvH6K\" id=\"link-4\">请求示例</h3><div class=\"qz-codeblock_view qz-mulit-codeblock qz-card-type-block\" data-type=\"multicodeblock\" data-value=\"data:%7B%22langs%22%3A%5B%7B%22language%22%3A%22python%22%2C%22text%22%3A%22def%20demo()%3A%5Cn%20%20import%20requests%5Cn%20%20uri%20%3D%20%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fad.oceanengine.com%2Fopen_api%2F2%2Ftools%2Fclue%2Fsmart_phone%2Fget%2F%5C%22%5Cn%20%20params%3D%7B%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%5C%22advertiser_id%5C%22%3A%200%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%5C%22page%5C%22%3A%20%5C%221%5C%22%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%5C%22page_size%5C%22%3A%20%5C%2210%5C%22%5Cn%20%20%20%7D%5Cn%20%20%20headers%20%3D%20%7B%5C%22Access-Token%5C%22%3A%20%5C%22xxx%5C%22%7D%5Cn%20%20%20rsp%20%3D%20requests.get(url%2C%20json%3Dparams%2C%20headers%3Dheaders)%5Cn%20%20%20rsp%20%3D%20json.loads(rsp.text)%5Cn%20%20%20return%20rsp%5Cn%22%7D%2C%7B%22language%22%3A%22java%22%2C%22text%22%3A%22public%20JSONObject%20getSmartPhone()%20%7B%5Cn%20%20%20%20String%20access_token%20%3D%20%5C%22xxx%5C%22%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20final%20Long%20advertiser_id%20%3D%200L%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20final%20int%20page%20%3D%201%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20final%20int%20page_size%20%3D%2010%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20%2F%2F%20%E8%AF%B7%E6%B1%82%E5%9C%B0%E5%9D%80%5Cn%20%20%20%20String%20open_api_url_prefix%20%3D%20%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fad.oceanengine.com%2Fopen_api%2F2%2F%5C%22%3B%5Cn%